---
import InnerPage from '../layouts/InnerPage.astro';
import { BOOK_CALL_URL } from '../config/site';
---

<InnerPage
	title="Case Studies"
	description="How TeleTrex helps startups and SMBs scale customer conversations with practical AI."
>
	<h1>Case Studies</h1>
	<p class="page-lead">
		Real outcomes beat buzzwords. Here are the kinds of results we have built. 
	</p>

	<article class="study">
		<h2 class="study__title">B2C real estate investment firm: scaling investor support and increasing conversion without scaling the business</h2>
		<p class="study__meta">Supportable Associate</p>
		<p class="prose-block">
      <p>
      An investment firm wanted to bring REIT investing online and scale from a $5 Million to a $1 Billion AUM REIT
			while providing a professional image of trust and integrity.  Investors required phone calls with the 5
      person team before investing and post-investment service and the costs to scale the fund were prohibitive.
      </p>
      <p>      
      Supportable was implemented on the web-presence and within two months, support costs were cut by two-thirds
      and conversions without human interaction exceed $1 Millon on a $15 Million fund at the time. Supportable
      answers questions intelligently, quickly, and securely taking the investor's situation in context, providing
      a friendly, effecient, and impactful experience.
      </p>
      <p>
      In addition, thanks to Supportable's built-in multi-language capabilites, investors could ask questions
      in the language of choice with automatic detection, extending the reach beyond that of the current support
      staff,
      </p>
		</p>
		<p class="study__result"><strong>Result:</strong> Faster scaling and reach while accelerating growth with lest cost.</p>
	</article>

	<article class="study">
		<h2 class="study__title">Non-profit: community order created from multi-vendor chaos, support scaled.</h2>
		<p class="study__meta">Supportable Community</p>
		<p class="prose-block">
      <p>
			Non-profits running lean on staff spend manual effort moving information between tools and can't scale and
      grow quickly enough.  Supportable Community not only provided a holistic, cohesive solution, it also
      provided answers and handled membership issues 24x7 in a single place and multiple languages.
      </p>
      <p>
      Our guided assistant technology turns issues around before they become tickets, resulting in reduced member
      churn and increased renewals, working 24x7x365.
      </p>          
      <p>
      Additional capabilites are easily added overtime without reengineering the solution, and all actions are
      monitored and analyzed for audits and security.  Monthly community Impact reports became a breeze with the
      dynamic capabilites of the system.
      </p>
      <p>
      If the system can't solve the problem, it directs the member or prospect to someone who can.
      </p>
      <p>
      Supportable Community releived the staff enough for them to generate new programs and grow.
      </p>          
		</p>
		<p class="study__result"><strong>Result:</strong> Staff focussed on growth, membership accelerated, resources increased.</p>
	</article>

	<article class="study">
		<h2 class="study__title">SaaS trial signups: clearer next steps</h2>
		<p class="study__meta">Custom workflow</p>
		<p class="prose-block">
			Trials were converting, but support tickets repeated the same onboarding FAQs. We paired concise,
			on-brand answers with links to the right docs—so success wasn’t the default handler for every
			tier-one question.
		</p>
		<p class="study__result"><strong>Result:</strong> Lighter support load at peak signup weeks.</p>
	</article>
  <p/>
	<p class="study cta-line">
		Want something similar?
		<a class="btn btn--primary" href={BOOK_CALL_URL}>Book a call</a>
	</p>
</InnerPage>

<style>
	.study {
		margin: 0 0 2rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
	}

	.study:last-of-type {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.study__title {
		margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}

	.study__meta {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		font-size: 0.8125rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		letter-spacing: 0.03em;
	}

	.study__result {
		margin: 1rem 0 0;
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}

	.study__result strong {
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	.cta-line {
		margin-top: 2rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem 1rem;
	}
</style>
